                                "sense_id": "5c838446-4689-3d7a-9d4b-3ab38dc53db2",
                                "text": "When I'm not honing my craft in episodic television, I do double-duty as a voice coach."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "09272299-7d5a-3b26-8626-b17c203ef94a",
                        "entry_id": "3099f9c9-4246-379e-8c02-c819030b9138",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sporadic, happening infrequently and irregularly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8398b8e-2c7d-4d97-8b16-88f79c007359",
                                "sense_id": "09272299-7d5a-3b26-8626-b17c203ef94a",
                                "text": "Fortunately, my episodic bouts of dizziness didn't prevent me from climbing Chichen Itzá."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b1fe54a9-6601-3616-b27a-d5598516d524",
                        "entry_id": "3099f9c9-4246-379e-8c02-c819030b9138",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Consisting of a sequence of seemingly unconnected episodes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3fce1b55-09bc-4d33-991d-54e2044599ae",
                                "sense_id": "b1fe54a9-6601-3616-b27a-d5598516d524",
                                "text": "I just read five attempts at episodic novels — has nobody heard of a plot anymore?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
